-- what the public server does not serve yet: the workflow's views (the graph, the explorer) and the history,
-- whose making takes the machine about 4.7 GB for 245 s (lib/views.cub, 2026-11-18), more than the public
-- host's 2 GB; a reader asking there is told nothing is published at the address
s-views-path : List Word → Bool
s-views-path p = orB (h-prefix "/graph" p) (orB (h-prefix "/api/" p) (orB (h-prefix "/hi" p) (h-prefix "/history" p)))
